        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word introduction covers direction of travel, boarding and disembarkation. It does not provide the equivalent public-facing nine-day route summary found in this RU lead."
      },
      "text": "This expedition sails from Puerto Montt to Ushuaia through the fjords of Chilean Patagonia, San Rafael and Bernardo O’Higgins national parks, the Messier Channel, the Strait of Magellan and Tierra del Fuego. Over nine days, the ship passes islands and glaciers and navigates narrow channels. Shore landings and boat outings depend on weather and navigation conditions."
